From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eduardo Ruiz <335073+eduarbo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:03:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make the home's slides and suggestions off the UI thread

- The first {system:slides} or suggestion of a system read every game and
  the size of each one's media on the UI thread. Now the UI thread reads the
  candidates from memory and one worker thread checks the files and orders
  them; the system view polls each frame and binds the card and the panel
  when they arrive. Lists made again keep showing the ones before them
  meanwhile.
- The first pool starts on the game the panel shows meanwhile (its
  best-rated favorite) when it is in it, so the panel does not jump.
- ImageGridComponent::updateTileBindings for one object.
